<title>AUSTRIA: Austria says EMU treaty should offer flexibility.</title>
<headline>Austria says EMU treaty should offer flexibility.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's central bank said on Friday it was against an overly strict interpretation of the Maastricht Treaty on European economic and monetary union (EMU) according to narrow statistical criteria.</p>
</text>
